## solution

#### recursive

```js
const flipTree = (root) => {
  if (root === null) return null;
  const left = flipTree(root.left);
  const right = flipTree(root.right);
  root.right = left;
  root.left = right;
  return root;
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

