## solution

#### recursive

```cpp
Node* flipTree(Node* root) {
  if (root == nullptr) {
    return nullptr;
  }

  Node* tmp = root->left;
  root->left = root->right;
  root->right = tmp;
  flipTree(root->left);
  flipTree(root->right);
  return root;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
